 行。考试级别无需与年级匹配。"居民"指Pembina Trails学区
 居民。如有疑问，请在Edsby上联系Beauchamp女士。点击附件
 获取注册链接或二维码。注册截止日期为10月26日。\n\n公
 告原文：\nDecember 1st and 2nd after school at Fort Richmond Collegiat
 e. A couple of important things to note: The level of exam that you take D
 OES NOT need to match your grade level. The poster says that you must be a
  "resident". This means a resident of Pembina Trails School Division\, whi
 ch all of you are. Please message Ms. Beauchamp on Edsby if you have any q
 uestions about the exam or registration. Click on the attachment for the r
 egistration link or QR code. Registration closes on
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T181805Z
